<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Feb official reserves S$110.21 bln - MAS.</title>
<headline>Singapore Feb official reserves S$110.21 bln - MAS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official foreign reserves</p>
<p>(billions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Feb 97    Jan 97    Feb 96</p>
<p>    Total official reserves	 110.21    109.05     99.78</p>
<p>Gold and foreign exchange</p>
<p>    reserves			    109.55    108.40     99.10</p>
<p>Special drawing rights (million)  244.6     240.6     238.7</p>
<p>    Reserve Position in IMF (million) 413.9     413.9     439.4</p>
<p>Source: Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS)</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
